      ******************************************************************        
        2410-COMPACTAR-NOMBRE-COMPLETO.                                         
      ******************************************************************        

      ** COMPACTAREMOS LOS APELLIDOS Y NOMBRE DEL BENEFICIARIO                  
           INITIALIZE WS-NOMBRE-COM                                             
           INITIALIZE WS-NOMBRE-COMPLETO                                        
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   

      ** COMPROBAMOS PERSONA FISICA O PERSONA JURIDICA                          
           IF X160N315-PPE-CTIPOPERS-S(CT-UNO) EQUAL 'J'                        

             MOVE X160N315-PPE-GNOMBRELARGO-S(CT-UNO) TO WS-NOMBRE-COM          

           ELSE                                                                 

      ** RECORREMOS EL PRIMER APELLIDO PARA ELIMINAR LOS ESPACIO EN             
      ** EL NOMBRE COMPLETO                                                     
              MOVE X160N315-PPE-GAPELLIDO1-S(CT-UNO)   TO WS-APELLIDO1          

              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 15                                       
                 IF WS-APELLIDO1(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                   
                    MOVE WS-APELLIDO1(INDICE-P:1)                               
                                     TO WS-NOMBRE-COM(INDICE-L:1)               
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                              
              END-PERFORM                                                       

              IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL CT-UNO                                      
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            

      ** RECORREMOS EL SEGUNDO APELLIDO PARA ELIMINAR LOS ESPACIO EN            
      ** EL NOMBRE COMPLETO                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                
              MOVE X160N315-PPE-GAPELLIDO2-S(CT-UNO)   TO WS-APELLIDO2          

              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 15                                       
                 IF WS-APELLIDO2(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                   
                    MOVE WS-APELLIDO2(INDICE-P:1)                               
                                          TO WS-NOMBRE-COM(INDICE-L:1)          
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                              
              END-PERFORM                                                       

              IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL CT-UNO                                      
                 MOVE ','             TO WS-NOMBRE-COM(INDICE-L:1)              
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            

              MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                

      ** RECORREMOS EL NOMBRE PARA ELIMINAR LOS ESPACIO EN                      
      ** EL NOMBRE COMPLETO                                                     
              MOVE X160N315-PPE-GNOMBRELARGO-S(CT-UNO) TO WS-NOMBRE             

              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 30                                       
                 IF WS-NOMBRE(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                      
                    MOVE WS-NOMBRE(INDICE-P:1)                                  
                      TO WS-NOMBRE-COM(INDICE-L:1)                              
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                              
              END-PERFORM                                                       

           END-IF                                                               
              .                                                                 

      ******************************************************************        
        2420-COMPACTAR-DOMICILIO.                                               
      ******************************************************************        
      ** COMPACTAREMOS EL DOMICILIO DEL BENEFICIARIO                            
           INITIALIZE WS-DOMICILIO-COM                                          
           INITIALIZE WS-DOMICILIO-COMPLETO                                     
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO XN-I                                                       

      ** RECORREREMOS LOS DIFERENTES CAMPOS PARA ELIMINAR LOS ESPACIOS          
      ** EN EL DOMICILIO                                                        

           PERFORM UNTIL XN-I > 10                                              
      *D*                                                                       
      *      DISPLAY 'XN-I' XN-I                                                
      *F*                                                                       
           IF X160N315-PDO-CTIPODOM-S(XN-I) EQUAL 'P'                           
      *D*                                                                       
      *      DISPLAY 'X160N315-PDO-CTIPODOM-S(XN-I)'                            
      *               X160N315-PDO-CTIPODOM-S(XN-I)                             
      *F*                                                                       
           MOVE X160N315-PDO-CTIPOVIA-S(XN-I)     TO WS-CTIPOVIA                

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 10                                          
              IF WS-CTIPOVIA(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                       
                 MOVE WS-CTIPOVIA(INDICE-P:1)                                   
                                         TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)        
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

           IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL XN-I                                           
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE X160N315-PDO-GDOMICILIO-S(XN-I)   TO WS-GDOMICILIO              

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 105                                         
              IF WS-GDOMICILIO(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                     
                 MOVE WS-GDOMICILIO(INDICE-P:1)                                 
                                         TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1))       
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

           IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL XN-I                                           
              MOVE ','             TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)              
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                                 
              MOVE 'NUM '          TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:4)              
              ADD 4 TO INDICE-L                                                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE X160N315-PDO-GNUMVIA-S(XN-I)      TO WS-NUMVIA                  

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 10                                          
              IF WS-NUMVIA(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                         
                 MOVE WS-NUMVIA(INDICE-P:1)                                     
                                      TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)           
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

           IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL XN-I                                           
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE X160N315-PDO-GDOMIRESTO-S(XN-I)   TO WS-GDOMIRESTO              

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 45                                          
              IF WS-GDOMIRESTO(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                     
                 MOVE  WS-GDOMIRESTO(INDICE-P:1)                                
                                      TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)           

                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          
           END-IF                                                               
           ADD 1 TO XN-I                                                        
           END-PERFORM                                                          
              .                                                                 
