           MOVE WS-GRELLENO                    TO X001N007-GRELLENO             
           MOVE WS-NLONG                       TO X001N007-NLONG                
           MOVE SPACES                         TO X001N007-CTIPOFRASE           

           EVALUATE X372VT09-TIPOEMI-E                                          
              WHEN CT-01                                                        
                  MOVE TB-IMPLIQCAP(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
              WHEN CT-02                                                        
                  MOVE TB-ILIQCOMP1(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
              WHEN CT-03                                                        
                  MOVE TB-ILIQCOMP2(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
           END-EVALUATE                                                         

           IF X001N007-ECANTIDAD NOT EQUAL ZEROES                               
              CALL WS-B001N007 USING X001N007                                   

              IF X001N007-CRETORNO NOT EQUAL '00'                               
                 SET ERROR-GRAVE                TO TRUE                         
